  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Direct award grant  to Department of Tourism</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;Grant to the Department of Tourism. The &lt;strong&gt;overall objective (Impact)&lt;/strong&gt; is to contribute to Malawi&#xbf;s sustainable development of the ecotourism sector.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;specific objective (Outcome)&lt;/strong&gt; is to enhance ecotourism coordination, research and marketing for increased opportunities in ecotourism.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;Output 1: Enhanced coordination of ecotourism developments at all levels &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;Output 2: Ecotourism attractions, products and services are certified and graded&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Output 3: Research and statistical reporting on ecotourism strengthened&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Output 4: Malawian ecotourism brand established&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Output 5: The capacity of local communities to manage and own ecotourism ventures enhanced, especially for women and youth business owners.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-cursor&quot;&gt;&#xbf;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
